 25 │     become takesPoint(Point(x: p.x, y: 1))
    │                       ─────────┬─────────
    │                                ╰─────────── passed by the address of its place
    │
    │ Help: keep the value where the caller's caller can lend it, and pass `&` or `&var` of it
    │
    │ Note: a struct, an enum, an array, a `str` and a slice are passed by the address of their place; a parameter passed on is in the frame of the caller's caller
